MEOW MENU DEVELOPMENT
0.5.1 (2026-05-27)
=====
- Code reorganized into seven domain modules (core, config, presets, search, places, launcher, ui)
- Foundation for future feature work
- All tests pass; Xfconf keys and translations stable

0.5.0 (2026-05-25)
=====
- reorganize repo root
- remove release branch, only use tag and GitHub Releases
- one unified CI pipeline to main branch

0.4.5 (2026-05-25)
=====
- fix other issues on Suse Leap 15.6
- packaging CI can be run on every branch
- reduce artifacts retention for non-release stuff

0.4.4 (2026-05-22)
=====
- fix broken packaging for Suse Leap
- simplify packaging CI

0.4.3 (2026-05-21)
=====
- fix broken dependencies from WhiskerMenu
- add dev-install.sh and dev-uninstall.sh | only for beta testers
- add uninstall guide to readme depending on installation method

0.4.2 (2026-05-20)
=====
- hotfix missing ubuntu package
- clarify official and unofficial multi-distro support in readme.md

0.4.1 (2026-05-20)
=====
- fix broken rpm package creation
- first test of GitHub CI for rpm/deb package attachments

0.4.0 (2026-05-19)
=====
- implement first CI workflow (main and release PRs)
- add tests for Fedora, Ubuntu, Debian
- fix small issues causing sanitizers failure
- fix small dependency issues between Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04 in readme

0.3.3 (2026-05-19)
=====
- update readme, last minor update before 0.4.x
- add --icons param to dev-reload.sh

0.3.2 (2026-05-17)
=====
- update github workflow to standardize release details
- remove Whisker's hard-coded version details
- brand new Meow icon added
- refactoring dev-load.sh to rebuild this launcher (for dev only)

0.3.1 (2026-05-17)
=====
- extend language support (using LLMs) to all the languages already supported by WhiskerMenu
- language support covers new Property and Places
- update readme

0.3.0 (2026-06-15)
=====
- Places brand new features to explore files and folders
- update readme and installation guide

0.2.3 (2026-05-14)
=====
- fix searchbar alignment in full screen layout
- fix sidebar disappearing when search in full screen layout
- update About window and README

0.2.2 (2026-05-13)
======
- complete refactor of Properties window for an easier customization
- adding simple conf files to edit default presets without Properties UI

0.2.1 (2026-05-12)
======
- bugfixing opacity issues in default presets
- improve FullScreen preset layout

0.2.0 (2026-05-09)
